    "interpretation": "This measures realized auto-renewal capability for income/eligibility verification during and after the unwinding. It is the best available empirical proxy for whether a state can clear an enrollee without forcing them to act. It is necessary but not sufficient for OBBBA work-requirement verification, which also needs hours/exemption data feeds (captured separately in the data_sources score).",
